OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prisoners left with no
OL,4,Arunning water or flushing toilets
OL,5,Aovernight
OL,6,
OL,7,FA number of prisoners in Scotland's
OL,8,Flargest jail had no running water in
OL,9,Ftheir cells overnight and no access to
OL,10,Fbottled water.
OL,12,FOne woman told BBC Scotland News that
OL,13,Fthe situation in HMP Barlinnie, which
OL,14,Fleft some inmates unable to flush the
OL,15,Ftoilet, was "completely unacceptable."
OL,17,FThe Scottish Prison Service (SPS) said
OL,18,Fa water supply issue had now been fixed
OL,19,Fbut, due to the age of the Glasgow
OL,20,Fjail, it would take time to return to
OL,21,Fnormal.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
